### Homeowners Voting Platform — end-to-end walkthrough
### Run the API first: dotnet run --project src/HoaVoting.Api
@host = http://localhost:5095

### 1. Admin login (seeded from Admin:Email / Admin:Password)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@hoa.local", "password": "change-me" }

@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}

### 2. Admin creates an association + its owner (calls Vocdoni: create org)
# @name createAssoc
POST {{host}}/api/associations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{ "name": "Maple Street Homeowners Voting Platform", "ownerEmail": "owner@maple.local", "ownerPassword": "owner-pw" }

@assocId = {{createAssoc.response.body.id}}

### 3. Owner logs in
# @name ownerLogin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "owner@maple.local", "password": "owner-pw" }

@ownerToken = {{ownerLogin.response.body.token}}

### 4. Owner adds a homeowner (Vocdoni: add org member)
POST {{host}}/api/associations/{{assocId}}/homeowners
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

{ "name": "Alice", "surname": "Doe", "email": "alice@maple.local", "memberNumber": "A-101", "weight": "1" }

### 5. Owner lists homeowners
GET {{host}}/api/associations/{{assocId}}/homeowners
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### 6. Owner checks the plan features (gates the anonymous toggle)
GET {{host}}/api/associations/{{assocId}}/features
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### 7. Owner creates a multi-question proposal (Vocdoni: POST /processes -> publish -> read back)
# kind = single | multiple | ranked | cumulative (budget + costExponent 1|2).
# anonymous = blind-CSP voting (plan-gated — see step 6).
# @name createProposal
POST {{host}}/api/associations/{{assocId}}/proposals
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

{
  "title": "Annual assembly",
  "description": "Two decisions for this year.",
  "anonymous": false,
  "startDate": "2026-06-24T00:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2026-07-01T00:00:00Z",
  "questions": [
    {
      "title": "Repaint the lobby?",
      "kind": "single",
      "choices": [ { "title": "Yes" }, { "title": "No" } ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Distribute the maintenance budget",
      "kind": "cumulative",
      "budget": 10,
      "costExponent": 1,
      "choices": [ { "title": "Garden" }, { "title": "Elevator" }, { "title": "Roof" } ]
    }
  ]
}

@proposalId = {{createProposal.response.body.id}}
@questionId = {{createProposal.response.body.questions[0].id}}

### 8. Read the proposal (live status + inline per-question tallies)
GET {{host}}/api/associations/{{assocId}}/proposals/{{proposalId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

### 9. Restrict a question's eligibility on the live process (complete list; [] = everyone).
# 409 with signedMemberIds when a voter who already holds a ballot signature would be removed.
PUT {{host}}/api/associations/{{assocId}}/proposals/{{proposalId}}/questions/{{questionId}}/eligibility
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}

{ "memberIds": [] }

### 10. Close voting
POST {{host}}/api/associations/{{assocId}}/proposals/{{proposalId}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{ownerToken}}
